                  <div class="life-at-delta">
                     <div class="life-at-delta__grid">
                        <h2 class="life-at-delta__title">Life at Delta</h2>
                        <div class="life-at-delta__copy">
                           <p class="x_x_MsoNormal">Delta isn’t your typical community college. We’ve always done things a little bigger—hosting
                              well-known speakers, building standout athletic programs and sharing global art with
                              our campus. It’s all part of the experience here.<br><br>Chasing big goals? Jump in and get involved.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="life-at-delta__cta"><a href="https://www.delta.edu/life-at-delta/index.html" class="btn--primary">Learn about life at Delta</a></div>
                        <figure class="image-card">
                           <div class="image-card__container"><img src="https://www.delta.edu/_resources/images/homepage-testimonials-gallery/homepage-gallery-fitness.png" alt="Cycling class"><div class="image-card__label">Fitness Center</div><a href="https://www.delta.edu/fitness-pool/index.html" class="image-card__link"><span class="visible-for-screen-readers">Fitness Center</span></a></div>
                           <figcaption class="image-card__caption">Ten free passes each academic year to flex your body and free your mind.</figcaption>
                        </figure>
                        <figure class="image-card">
                           <div class="image-card__container"><img src="https://www.delta.edu/_resources/images/homepage-testimonials-gallery/homepage-gallery-clubs.png" alt="Color Run"><div class="image-card__label">Clubs</div><a href="https://www.delta.edu/life-at-delta/clubs-organizations.html" class="image-card__link"><span class="visible-for-screen-readers">Clubs</span></a></div>
                           <figcaption class="image-card__caption">Your launchpad to friendship, fun and finding your people.</figcaption>
                        </figure>
                        <article class="poster-card">
                           <div class="poster-card__eyebrow">Did you know?</div>
                           <div class="poster-card__feature-text"><strong>1 in 3</strong> local high school students choose Delta.</div>
                        </article>
                        <figure class="image-card">
                           <div class="image-card__container"><img src="https://www.delta.edu/_resources/images/homepage-testimonials-gallery/homepage-gallery-3-volleyball.png" alt="Volleyball player"><div class="image-card__label">Athletics</div><a href="https://www.delta.edu/life-at-delta/athletics/index.html" class="image-card__link"><span class="visible-for-screen-readers">Athletics</span></a></div>
                           <figcaption class="image-card__caption">Champions train here. Suit up or show up—we’re all Ducks in this pond.</figcaption>
                        </figure>
                        <figure class="image-card">
                           <div class="image-card__container"><img src="https://www.delta.edu/_resources/images/homepage-testimonials-gallery/homepage-gallery-1-observatory.png" alt="Nebula"><div class="image-card__label">Observatory</div><a href="https://www.delta.edu/observatory/index.html" class="image-card__link"><span class="visible-for-screen-readers">Observatory</span></a></div>
                           <figcaption class="image-card__caption"><span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">Spend an evening under the stars at the Delta Dome Observatory.</span></figcaption>
                        </figure>
                     </div>
                  </div> 
                  
